    "recommendations": "Maintaining a single clearly marked access point serving a long driveway and multiple structures could benefit from clearly visible address signage posted at the street frontage to support rapid navigation by responding units. Preserving adequate width and vertical clearance along the driveway and unpaved circulation route may assist larger emergency vehicles in reaching all structures, including those with limited rear access. Designating a staging area within the vehicle parking area or open green space could facilitate simultaneous multi-unit operations across the property. Ensuring the circulation route between structures remains unobstructed would support responder movement throughout the site."
